BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:5th Annual Route 66 UltraRun
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTSTAMP:20261030T170708Z
UID:43171bbd989b032f2960eec7@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:140 Miles of History and A Race for Everyone - The race recogn
 izes and celebrates the history of the Mother Road. From the Bunion Derbie
 s\; “Oakie’s” during the Dust Bowl\; the boom years of family road t
 rips after WWII\; decline after the interstate system bypassed mom- and-po
 p motels\, restaurants\, and shops\; to grassroots resurgence leading to o
 fficial recognition that Route 66 had “become a symbol of the American p
 eople’s heritage of travel and their legacy of seeking a better life.”
  Options are available for a fast solo runner\, a team player or even a wa
 lker.\n\nEvent website: https://route66ultrarun.com/\n\nVisit Arizona list
 ing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/5th-annual-route-66-ultrarun
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T170708Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/5th-annual-route-66-ultrarun
END:VEVENT
